ESP-IDF v5.4.4

This project is tested against ESP-IDF v5.4.4 for the ESP32-S3 target.

Setup:
  git clone --branch v5.4.4 --depth 1 --recursive https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf.git ~/esp/esp-idf-v5.4.4
  cd ~/esp/esp-idf-v5.4.4
  ./install.sh esp32s3
  . ./export.sh

Before the first project build, or after switching ESP-IDF versions:
  rm -rf build sdkconfig sdkconfig.old
  idf.py set-target esp32s3
  idf.py build
